        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 61,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（やはり我々こそがトップに相応しいのだと、\n知らしめるはずだったのに……！）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_j:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 61,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……。だが……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_j:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 61,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "私が見たかった、トップアイドルの姿とは……。\n本当に、そんなものだったんだろうか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_j:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 61,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……。分からない。もう私では、見つけることも、\nこの手で生み出すことも出来ないのかもしれない……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_j:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 61,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……そうだな。トップアイドルとは、一体何か？\nここにいる誰もが、うまく説明できないんじゃないか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "葛之葉 雨彦"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_j:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 61,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "だからこそ、その姿を想像し、憧れ、\n皆、夢中で追いかけているのかもしれない。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "硲 道夫"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_j:step-19:text",
        "step_id": 19,
        "step_index": 18,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 61,
          "target_step_index": 18
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "アイドルって世界には、\nそれだけ夢がいっぱいだからね！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_j:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 61,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "同じ夢を持つ者同士、肩を貸しあって、\nそれがどんなものなのか、探しに行かないか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "信玄 誠司"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_j:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 61,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "しんげんさんの肩は、頼り甲斐あるよ～。多分、俺と\nもう2、3人乗っかっても、軽々前に進んでくれるよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "山下 次郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_j:step-25:text",
        "step_id": 25,
        "step_index": 24,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 61,
          "target_step_index": 24
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ふふ。そんなパワフルで、諦めが悪くて、\n何があっても走り続ける、俺たち315プロと一緒に。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_j:step-28:text",
        "step_id": 28,
        "step_index": 27,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 61,
          "target_step_index": 27
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "トップアイドルって夢を、\nもう一度追いかけに行こうよ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "渡辺 みのり"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_j:step-29:text",
        "step_id": 29,
        "step_index": 28,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 61,
          "target_step_index": 28
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……。敵である私にまで手を差し伸べるとは、\nどこまでも図々しいヤツらだな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_j:step-33:text",
        "step_id": 33,
        "step_index": 32,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_10_j",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_10_j.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 61,
          "target_step_index": 32
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "だが、おかげで目が覚めたよ。……ありがとう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アイドル業界の大物"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_10_j:step-34:text",
        "step_id": 34,
